flowchart TD
    A["Product project and target customer"] --> B["Check ownership; link Company and Contacts"]
    B --> C["Material, specification, application, volume and next action"]
    C --> D{"Sample needed?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["Local or HQ sample: batch, COA and tracking"]
    E --> F["Customer receipt and test feedback"]
    F -->|Revise or retest| C
    F -->|Accepted| G["Support pricing: cost, freight, duties and market"]
    D -->|No: record reason| G
    G --> H["Versioned indicative quote: price, quantity, packaging, terms and validity"]
    H --> I{"Pricing exception?"}
    I -->|Yes| J["Commercial review: supervisor routing is a demo default"]
    J -->|Rejected| H
    J -->|Approved current version| K["Record quote communication"]
    I -->|No| K
    K --> L["Customer feedback and dated follow-up"]
    L -->|Negotiate| H
    L -->|Lost| LOST["Close Lost with reason"]
    L -->|PO received| M["Capture PO, exact quote version and quality requirements"]
    M --> N["Co-worker review → branch manager → OSBO"]
    N -->|Correct and resubmit| M
    N -->|Approved| O{"Finance and supply cleared?"}
    O -->|No| HOLD["Resolve credit, prepayment, stock or supply blocker"]
    HOLD --> O
    O -->|Yes| P["Formal customer confirmation; record Won"]
    P --> Q{"Order type?"}
    Q -->|Standard| R["Single full-quantity release"]
    Q -->|Blanket| S["Customer-confirmed dated releases within remaining quantity"]
    S --> R
    R --> T["SAP handoff by stable release reference"]
    T -->|Failed or uncertain| U["Reconcile same release"]
    U --> T
    T -->|Acknowledged| V["Delivery and customer follow-up"]
    MODE["Demo implementation: approvals, confirmation email and SAP responses are simulated. Target human approval channel: Feishu."] -.-> J
    MODE -.-> N
    MODE -.-> P
    MODE -.-> T
